# Template only: NEVER commit credentials. See GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS.md.
# Compose: copy to .env.google, chmod 600, then edit privately on the host.
# Native Node: use supervisor environment variables or a protected .env.
# Browser key: website/referrer restriction; Maps JavaScript API only.
GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_API_KEY=
# Server keys: egress-IP restriction; Geocoding API / Solar API respectively.
# One server key may serve both APIs by setting BOTH variables to that value privately.
# Never reuse a server key as the browser key.
GOOGLE_GEOCODING_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_SOLAR_API_KEY=
